": "bL", "text": "120", "originalText": "120", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el85", "type": "text", "x": 1100, "y": 796, "width": 684.32, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1085, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2085, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "bM", "text": "Au moins un des deux doit être actif, sinon la centrale ne saura pas si l'alarme est en panne.", "originalText": "Au moins un des deux doit être actif, sinon la centrale ne saura pas si l'alarme est en panne.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el88", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1080, "y": 1026, "width": 720, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1088, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2088, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "bP"}, {"id": "el89", "type": "text", "x": 1090, "y": 1034, "width": 546.0, "height": 65.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1089, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2089, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "bQ", "text": "Profil « Personnalisé » (mode expert) : mêmes écrans, plus aucun cadenas,\ntous les champs ci-dessus deviennent modifiables, sans bandeau particulier.\nPhoto / vidéo : chaque contenu s'active ou non, et son format se choisit,\nen Personnalisé seulement.", "originalText": "Profil « Personnalisé » (mode expert) : mêmes écrans, plus aucun cadenas,\ntous les champs ci-dessus deviennent modifiables, sans bandeau particulier.\nPhoto / vidéo : chaque contenu s'active ou non, et son format se choisit,\nen Personnalisé seulement.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el90", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2120, "y": 0, "width": 700, "height": 716, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1090, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2090, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "bR"}, {"id": "el91", "type": "text", "x": 2140, "y": -34, "width": 693.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1091, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2091, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "bS", "text": "ÉCRAN C - Étape 2, la centrale refuse (DUH), options avancées repliées", "originalText": "ÉCRAN C - Étape 2, la centrale refuse (DUH), options avancées repliées", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "el100", "type": "text", "x": 2140, "y": 80, "width": 453.6, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", 